OL,3,GNEWSA'Terrorist connection' over Trump
OL,4,ATurnberry vandalism charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people accused of vandalism at
OL,7,FDonald Trump's Turnberry golf resort
OL,8,Fhave been charged with an offence
OL,9,Falleged to have a "terrorist
OL,10,Fconnection".
OL,12,FThe allegation is contained in an
OL,13,Findictment lodged with the High Court
OL,14,Fof Justiciary in Glasgow over the
OL,15,Fincident that happened at the Ayrshire
OL,16,Fresort during a protest on 8 March
OL,17,F2025.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
