OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Terrorist connection' over Trump
OL,4,ATurnberry vandalism charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt states that the offence was
OL,7,Faggravated under Section 31 of the
OL,8,FCounter-Terrorism Act 2008, as amended
OL,9,Fby the Counter-Terrorism and Sentencing
OL,10,FAct 2021, because it had a "terrorist
OL,11,Fconnection".
OL,13,FThe Defend Our Juries group has
OL,14,Fcriticised the move, claiming the
OL,15,Faccused could face "far longer prison
OL,16,Fsentences" despite not being charged
OL,17,Fwith terrorism offences.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
